# Declarative user/group creation for structured-proxy.
# Processed by systemd-sysusers on first boot and on package install/upgrade.
# Reference: sysusers.d(5).
#
# The proxy is stateless, so the account owns no home/state directory — it
# exists only to run the service unprivileged and read /etc/structured-proxy.
#
# Type Name              ID  GECOS                                   Home  Shell
u     structured-proxy   -   "structured-proxy transcoding proxy"    -     /usr/sbin/nologin
